2. **`DISCOUNT_RATE = 0.10`** — `0.1` and `0.10` are numerically identical in JavaScript/TypeScript. No real behavioral drift.

3. **`DATABASE_URL` rename** — README, SPEC.md, and config.ts are all consistently updated. No drift.

